  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The proposed front garden hardstanding,\r\nreprofiling and hard landscaping works, with particular reference to the\r\nvisually significant loss of the characteristic Metroland soft landscaping, would\r\nappear a stark and historically alien feature to the detriment and at odds with\r\nthe character and appearance of the original property, the pioneering Metroland\r\nstyle and the Tookes Green Conservation Area. The proposed development would\r\nfail to preserve the Conservation Area and thereby be contrary to the high-quality\r\ndesign aspirations of the National Planning Policy Framework (2023), Policies\r\nD3 and HC1 of The London Plan (2021), Policies DM1 and DM7 of Harrow’s\r\nDevelopment Management Policies Local Plan document (2013) and the relevant\r\nprovisions of the adopted Harrow Supplementary Planning Document Residential Design\r\nGuide (2010) and &lt;span style=&quot;background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;&quot;&gt;Tookes Green\r\nConservation Area&lt;/span&gt; Appraisal and Management Strategy&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
